{
  "_v6": "Workstreams are found by topic (selection, identity, migration tokens in the name), not by the exact names the v5 key invented and neither the request nor the folder gives. The migration dependency may be REQ-012 itself or the identity workstream by name. The last milestone accepts the memo's own phrase (on the shared tool). Same 20 assertions. Pilot ready may be dated 2027-06-18 (the memo's suggestion) or 2027-06-17 (capacity-2027.csv lists 2027-06-18 as a holiday). The open-question topics are matched by topic words, not one fixed word each.",
